            </note>
            <note corresp="#d210-f2" n="3" xml:id="d210-f2-content">
                <p>The italicized words and passages were additions proposed by the Department of
                    Defense.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d210-f3" n="4" xml:id="d210-f3-content">
                <p>“Consider” replaced the word “seek.”</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d210-f4" n="5" xml:id="d210-f4-content">
                <p>“Facilitating” replaced the words “to expand.”</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d210-f5" n="6" xml:id="d210-f5-content">
                <p>“Consider” replaced the phrase “be forthcoming in considering approval of.”</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
